description:
Design a 4-bit shift register with a parallel load capability. When the load signal is active, the register captures the 4-bit input data. On each positive clock edge, if not loading, the register shifts its contents to the left by one bit, introducing a zero at the least significant bit. The current contents of the shift register are continuously available at the output.
module top_module( input         clk
  , input         load
  , input  [3:0]  data_in
  , output [3:0]  data_out
  );

code:
module top_module( input         clk
  , input         load
  , input  [3:0]  data_in
  , output [3:0]  data_out
  );reg [3:0] shift_reg;

  always @(posedge clk)
  begin
    if (load)
      shift_reg <= data_in;
    else
      shift_reg <= {shift_reg[2:0], 1'b0};
  end

  assign data_out = shift_reg;

endmodule

