description:
Design a synchronous 2-to-1 multiplexer with an active low reset. The output Y is updated on the rising edge of the clock signal (CLK). If the reset (RST) input is asserted, the output is set to LOW. Otherwise, the multiplexer selects between inputs A and B based on the select signal S; when S is 0, Y follows A, and when S is 1, Y follows B.
module top_module(
	input A, B, S, CLK, RST,
	output reg Y
);

