description:
Design a transition counter that increments a 32-bit output count based on changes in the input signal X. The module captures the state of X on both its rising and falling edges, updating a state register that uses two bits to track the transitions. The count is incremented whenever the two most significant bits of the state differ, indicating a change in the value of X.
